    "Steam Deck also sets Aspect Ratio to 16:10, Render Resolution to 720p (1280 x 800) and VSync to Off on the Display tab, and Swap Gyro Yaw/Roll and Invert Gyro Yaw on the Controller tab. Changing a choice makes the preset Custom. With Texture Streaming below the GPU's memory, textures keep fewer mip levels: first those not drawn for a while, then the largest.": "“Steam Deck”还会将“显示”选项卡的“宽高比”设为 16:10、“渲染分辨率”设为 720p (1280 x 800)、“垂直同步”设为“关闭”，并开启“控制器”选项卡的“交换陀螺仪偏航/翻滚”和“反转陀螺仪偏航”。更改任一选项后，预设会变为“自定义”。当“纹理流送”低于 GPU 显存时，纹理保留的 Mip 级别会减少：先从一段时间未绘制的纹理开始，然后是最大的纹理。",
